HERO-66641 — Feature Refinement Note

:root {
--text: #1a1a1a;
--muted: #555;
--border: #ccc;
--head: #1e3a5f;
--new: #b45309;
--bg: #fff;
--table-head: #f0f4f8;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
font-family: "Segoe UI", Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
font-size: 11pt;
line-height: 1.45;
color: var(--text);
max-width: 210mm;
margin: 0 auto;
padding: 16mm 18mm;
background: var(--bg);
}
h1 {
font-size: 16pt;
color: var(--head);
border-bottom: 2px solid var(--head);
padding-bottom: 8px;
margin: 0 0 12px;
}
h2 {
font-size: 13pt;
color: var(--head);
margin: 22px 0 10px;
padding-bottom: 4px;
border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
h3 {
font-size: 11.5pt;
color: var(--head);
margin: 16px 0 8px;
}
.badge {
display: inline-block;
font-size: 9pt;
font-weight: 600;
padding: 2px 8px;
border-radius: 3px;
background: #dbeafe;
color: #1e40af;
}
.note-inline {
font-size: 10pt;
color: var(--muted);
margin: 0 0 20px;
padding: 10px 12px;
background: #f8fafc;
border-left: 4px solid var(--border);
}
table {
width: 100%;
border-collapse: collapse;
margin: 10px 0 16px;
font-size: 10pt;
}
th, td {
border: 1px solid var(--border);
padding: 6px 8px;
text-align: left;
vertical-align: top;
}
th { background: var(--table-head); font-weight: 600; }
ol, ul { margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 22px; }
li { margin: 4px 0; }
.new { color: var(--new); font-weight: 600; }
.workflow-meta { font-size: 10pt; color: var(--muted); margin: 6px 0 10px; }
.workflow-meta strong { color: var(--text); }
.workflow-block { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.footer {
margin-top: 28px;
padding-top: 12px;
border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
font-size: 9pt;
color: var(--muted);
}
@media print {
body { padding: 12mm; max-width: none; }
h2 { page-break-after: avoid; }
table, .workflow-block { page-break-inside: avoid; }
}

Feature Refinement Note

HERO-66641   POS - TMS Interface - Support payment total and room charge amount in check-completion message

Status: Final — version-02 — 2026-08-19

Regional / PO / support export (sections 1–9). Developers use refinement-functional (full note, sections 1–12).

1. Summary (target of the enhancement)

Extend the existing Thankyou Message from POS to internal TMS so the message includes payment summary and per-payment details needed by CRM (e.g. Swire Hotels China).

Scope changed (2026-08-19) (vs original JIRA request for payment total + room charge amount only). Added: payment name, payment code. Removed: payment tips. The Thankyou Message must include:

- Payment total — sum of all payments applied to the check

- For each applied payment: payment code, payment amount, and payment name (language for payment name — TBC-2)

Trigger logic for Thankyou Message is unchanged — only the message content is extended.

Out of scope: Payment tips in Thankyou Message; new setup; new operator messages; changes to when Thankyou Message fires.

