3. Detailed workflow

Workflow: Thankyou Message — include payment total and per-payment details

Availability: Existing Thankyou Message (check attached with reservation; existing trigger events unchanged)

Restrictions: No change to when Thankyou Message is fired. No dedicated waiter function key — system-fired as today.

- Check has reservation attached (from mark arrival) and an existing Thankyou Message trigger occurs (e.g. check fully settled, check released, adjust payment after settled, or check voided after settled — per existing rules).

- System fires Thankyou Message to internal TMS using the existing trigger logic (unchanged).

- 【Changed】 Thankyou Message content includes payment total (all payments applied to the check) and, for each applied payment: payment code, payment amount, and payment name. Payment tips are not included. Language for payment name is TBC-2.

- Internal TMS receives the message per the updated TMS specification (TBC-1 resolved in round 2).

